Package: s20xHelpR
Type: Package
Title: Helper Functions for Producing the STATS 20x Course Notes
Version: 0.2.0.001
Date: 2026-11-05
Authors@R: c(
    person("James", "Curran", , "j.curran@auckland.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "Wrote the original R package. Current maintainer."))
Description: Provides functions that help with the production of the STATS 20x
    notes. They renumber code chunks and plot files in knitr and R Markdown
    sources, check those sources for common problems, and produce compact model
    summaries and tightly cropped figures.
